1
00:00:00,679 --> 00:00:05,309
Just, uh, out of curiosity,
did he ever have a shot with you?

2
00:00:05,475 --> 00:00:08,515
(Girl:)Are you insane?
The guy was wearing an eye patch.

3
00:00:09,396 --> 00:00:13,736
- So then why did you...?
- He said that I could drive a car on Mars.

4
00:00:14,693 --> 00:00:16,273
(Raj:)- Got it.
- Yeah.

5
00:00:17,654 --> 00:00:20,034
(Leonard:)So can I see you again?

6
00:00:20,198 --> 00:00:22,658
You're not done seeing me now.

7
00:00:23,869 --> 00:00:25,039
LEONARD:
Hm.

8
00:00:25,203 --> 00:00:26,783
(Leonard:)Cool.

9
00:00:29,082 --> 00:00:30,872
[KEYS CLICKING]

10
00:00:32,586 --> 00:00:33,716
(Howard:)Anything?

11
00:00:34,463 --> 00:00:36,343
(Raj:)Actually, I was just checking my e-mail.

12
00:00:37,966 --> 00:00:40,756
(Raj:)But, uh, no, the rover is not responding.

13
00:00:40,927 --> 00:00:44,267
(Sheldon:)I believe the appropriate metaphor here
involves a river of excrement...

14
00:00:44,431 --> 00:00:48,391
(Sheldon:)...and a Native American water vessel
without any means of propulsion.

15
00:00:48,768 --> 00:00:50,938
Hang on, there's gotta be other options.

16
00:00:51,104 --> 00:00:53,524
You could try calling AAA.

17
00:00:54,024 --> 00:00:57,614
(Raj:)But based on NASA's latest timetable,
they won't get there for 35 years.

18
00:00:58,778 --> 00:01:03,738
Plus, I understand you have to be next to
the vehicle with your card when they arrive.

